WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
This series is crafted for the purpose of entertainment.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.800
All characters, behaviours, settings, and events depicted in this drama are entirely fictitious.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.640
They are not designed to allude to any particular entity, occupation, or group of people.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.960
Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:12.040
Prom's close companion.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.320
Must've the one who broke into
Luang Sanong's mansion last night.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.200
Now it's certain that Prom is associated with the party.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.840
Khun Prom know Pra Nai best, you're perfect for this.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:27.920
Please stop this.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.200
Do not disappoint father anymore than this.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.680
I love you Kaewta.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.360
Even though I'm not the beautiful lady?

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.560
I still insist that love is love.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:43.840
Kaew! What happened? Are you okay?

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.160
Khun Yai, Saan where are you right now?.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.280
Please be safe out there.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.080
Khun Yai and I won't die so easily like that, Nanny.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.040
Father.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.920
Brother!
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.320
Where have you been, Brother?

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:15.320
And where did you get those clothes from?

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.000
Where were you, son? Why didn’t you come home?

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:33.120
I had something urgent to take care of.

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:36.280
Is that so?

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.160
Yes, Father.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:44.240
Next time, please send someone to inform us first, Brother. We were worried sick about you.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.720
I’ll send my servant next time.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.160
I’m glad you’re all right.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:01.480
Yes, Father.

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:42.920
♫ Let my thought of you drifted along the wind ♫

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:51.120
♫ Carrying with it my love to the very far-end ♫

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:58.120
♫ With faint smell of flowers in the air ♫

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:06.320
♫ Hoping it’d reach that person waiting on the other side ♫

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:12.720
♫ Sending all my love through the air ♫

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:21.560
♫ I miss you so much more than you can imagine ♫

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:28.280
♫ Just want you know I don’t want anything ♫

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:38.200
♫ You don’t have to return the feelings if you don’t want to ♫

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:03.120
♫ May the wind carry this song…♫

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:11.120
♫…in my heart to you ♫

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:19.480
♫No matter for how long, I’ll always love you ♫

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:24.560
♫I’ll love you…until the time is through ♫

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.080
[Interminable]
♫I’ll love you…until the time is through ♫

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:31.120
[Interminable]

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.200
Khun Yai, do you think Khun Prom will stop now?

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.440
I really can’t tell, Saen.

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.520
But I do hope he will.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:02.240
That man, has regained consciousness?

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:07.040
Not yet, sir. The doctor said
he’s in a coma and might not make it.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:16.400
If we can’t get the namelist of those traitors, our work might become more difficult.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.240
What should we do then?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:31.160
I must inform our people at the palace about their movements first.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.000
Kan! Kan!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.400
What’s the matter, Kaew?

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.320
Can you teach me the sword move?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.800
I used to ask you so many times to practise it with me.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:07.960
How come you want to do it today?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:09.920
It’s just in case…

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:11.000
In case?

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.640
Enough with the questions. Come on then.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.720
Fine, I won’t go easy on you.

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:22.640
Geez, you can’t even hold it right.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.400
Uncle.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.720
Good evening.

00:06:41.159 --> 00:06:46.080
Bless you, dear. What matter has brought you here?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:50.120
Are you sure, Som?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.680
Yes, Miss.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:56.960
People at the market are talking that Khun Phra Nai is infatuated with a dancer at Luang Sanor’s place.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.040
A dancer at Luang Sanor’s place?

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:13.240
Lady Sophee is here to select dancers to perform at the Queen Mother’s ceremony.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.360
Go on and pick anyone you like.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:22.640
Thank you, Uncle.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:52.080
Miss, that’s a guy not a girl.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:15.600
This girl…

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:22.240
Kaew, there’s a show performing over there. Let’s go see it.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.880
I’ll have this one.

00:08:33.039 --> 00:08:34.799
Thank you very much, Miss.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:48.280
Can you please help pick the rest for me, Uncle?

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:55.800
Of course. Kan and Kaew, you two should also go with Ruedee.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:58.880
Yes, sir.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:23.880
Why wasting your time, Miss? Just slap her in the face,

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:27.280
teach her a lesson and I’m sure she won’t mess with Khun Phra Nai again.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:32.880
For a girl who doesn’t know her place and tries to seduce my man,

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.600
do you really believe just a slap is enough?

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:40.520
What if she runs to him and plays victim to make him pity her even more?

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:47.120
Or worse, what would I do if she tries to make him hate me?

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:51.240
You’re right, Miss. How clever of you.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.280
Brother!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.520
Sophee.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:09.360
I want to let you know that the Queen Mother has kindly chosen me…

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:11.680
to be in charge of the ceremony for her.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:16.840
Earlier, I went to Uncle’s place to pick the dancers to perform at the event.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:21.320
You went to see Uncle? Which dancers have you picked?

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:26.680
I believe they are Ruedee, Kan, and Kaewta.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:32.120
That’s good. All of Uncle’s dancers are very talented.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.920
Yes, indeed. I must be visiting Uncle’s place more often to watch the rehearsal.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.720
Can you please come with me, Brother?

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.400
Of course. If I'm not busy, I’ll go with you.

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:50.440
Thank you, Brother.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.720
I must be going then.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:07.360
Miss, why would you invite him too?

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:12.600
I want to be sure if that girl is the dancer people are talking about.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:25.720
Som.

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:27.560
Yes, Miss?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.480
Have you done what I told you to do?

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:36.160
I already told Lady Sophee about Khun Phra Nai being infatuated with the dancer,

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:39.320
at Luang Sanor’s place –exactly as you’ve ordered, Master Prom.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:44.520
She has now found a way to deal with that dancer.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.800
Good. You did well.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:51.120
Follow up on this and keep me informed about it. You can go now.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:52.760
Is that all, sir?

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.080
What else do you want?!

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.360
That’s all, sir.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:04.440
What are you thinking, sir? Why did you ask her to tell Lady Sophee that?

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:10.760
That brat already knew about us. We can’t stick to our old plan now.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:15.200
If he’s dead, his people will have a reason to attack us.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:20.040
That’s why Chief has told me to do something to keep him distracted…

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:22.640
while Chief and the association are working on a big plan.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.040
I see.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:28.680
If Khun Phra Nai is busy with something else, he wouldn’t have time to investigate on us.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.280
And we’d be able to do things more easily.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.440
That’s right.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:39.200
Once our job is done, I won’t have to be afraid anymore that Father might find out about it.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:41.280
Because by then,

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:45.200
history shall have my name written as one of the people who has led this reform.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.160
Kaewta dances so beautifully, Uncle.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.120
Yes, he’s my best student.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.200
Hello, Uncle.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.600
Oh, you also came?

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:59.560
I’ve asked him to come and watch the rehearsal together.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:17.840
Sophee is quite meticulous. She wants me to help ensure the performance would be perfect.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:23.920
But I believe your dancers already look utterly beautiful…

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:32.360
I mean, they’re already doing so well I wouldn’t have to worry about it.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:55.440
I’m certain now that I’ve picked the right person, Som.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:00.160
Yes, Miss.

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:13.920
Kaew.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.000
Khun Yai.

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.000
Are you going home?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.400
Yes.

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:21.760
I’ll go with you.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:27.760
You can’t. Someone might see us and get the wrong idea.

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:31.480
How wrong? I’d say they’re right.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:34.960
Khun Yai…

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.040
Kaew.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.520
I miss you so much.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:50.360
Please stop. Let’s not make it more complicated.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.560
Kaew.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.560
I know you’re scared.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.440
I used to be like that too.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:05.040
Do you think I’ve never tried to restrain myself?

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:09.680
I’ve done it all, Kaew. And had my heart almost torn into pieces.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.600
I can’t stop loving you, Kaewta.

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:17.800
Khun Yai…

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:22.840
Don’t you find it painful?

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.720
Look into my eyes and answer me.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:38.160
Tell me if you can restrain yourself without feeling any pain, then I’ll let you go.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.160
Kaew…

00:16:55.400 --> 00:17:02.680
Yes, I don’t feel anything. It doesn’t hurt at all.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:03.720
Liar.

00:17:04.359 --> 00:17:07.720
I can’t help it if you don’t believe me.

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.839
Kaew…Kaew…

00:17:17.319 --> 00:17:19.240
If both of us shall be suffering from love,

00:17:20.079 --> 00:17:22.880
wouldn’t it be better to fight for it and go through the suffering together…

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:28.640
instead of going through it while hiding our feelings as if they were a sin?

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.000
Kaew, are you up yet?

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:05.960
Huh? Kaew?

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:10.040
What’s wrong, Mother Chan?

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.320
I can’t find Kaew anywhere, dear.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:29.840
Kaew!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.200
- Kaew!
- Can you hear me?

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.520
- My baby.
- Kaew.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.280
- Kaew! Can you hear me?
- My baby.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.400
Kaew. Kaew.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.640
The incense stick has probably burnt out for quite some time.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:45.280
Kaew. Kaew.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:47.320
- My baby.
- He’s not responding at all.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:48.560
What should we do?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.400
So beautiful.

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:16.880
I’m warning you, Saen. If you only keep looking but not making any move,

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:21.000
someone else might come and snatch the flower you’ve been admiring one day.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:27.480
A widower with a kid like me wouldn’t dare to reach out for such a beautiful flower.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.800
As long as you believe it in your heart,

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:40.240
even a dewdrop in the midst of a morning ray shall cast a reflection more beautiful than the sunrise itself.

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:45.880
A dewdrop will soon disappear after the sunrise.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:53.960
But I do believe your sincerity will overcome all obstacles.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:21.040
Look at Khun Phra Nai, Miss. His eyes have never left that Ruedee girl.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.480
What do you think, Sophee?

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:48.320
How elegant indeed. I’ve never seen anyone who could dance so gracefully like your dancers, Uncle.

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:52.160
I’ve made the right decision to ask for your help.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:57.240
Really? You’re not saying it just to please an old man like me, are you?

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:03.480
Let’s ask my brother then. Don’t you think so too, Brother?

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.320
I also agree with Sophee, Uncle.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:13.000
Your dancers can dance so beautifully and gracefully more than any dancers I’ve seen in the city.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.160
I’m glad to hear that indeed.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:30.920
So, shall we stop here and let them get some rest? They’re probably exhausted now.

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:33.520
All right, off you go then.

00:21:42.080 --> 00:21:45.960
I’ve prepared some food and desserts for them too.

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:14.120
How is it? Do you find it to your liking?

00:22:14.880 --> 00:22:18.440
It’s delicious. But I like it more flavorful though.

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:21.440
Do most elites prefer food like this?

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:26.400
You should be thankful. How lucky we are to be able to eat something from Chao Phraya Narubodin’s place.

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:31.200
To be honest, Lady Sophee is quite nice, isn’t she?

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.600
Not like the rumor I’ve heard.

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:38.600
Where are Kaew and Kan?

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:42.360
Those two are busy moving musical instruments.

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:44.680
Have they eaten?

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:49.360
Don’t worry, those guys already took their portion of the food to that side.

00:22:50.280 --> 00:22:51.080
I see.

00:22:58.680 --> 00:23:01.160
Hey, Lady Sophee wants to talk to you.

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:03.240
Me?

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:04.440
Hmm.

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:05.880
Yes.

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:20.440
Oh dear, come sit up here. I don't mind at all.

00:23:20.480 --> 00:23:23.400
I’m afraid I can’t, Miss.

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:26.840
Just do as you’re told.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.880
I wouldn’t dare, Miss.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:33.080
Let her be then, Miss.

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:35.880
She’s someone who knows her place after all.

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:41.080
Is there something you wish to talk to me, Miss?

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:43.840
I made you desserts.

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.320
Thank you, Miss. How fortunate of me.

00:23:53.080 --> 00:23:57.960
Seeing that you’ve practised so hard, she’d like to give you some encouragement.

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:03.720
It’s my brother's favourite. He asked me to learn how to do it.

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:07.880
So that one day when we get married, I could…

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:12.000
A perfect housewife for Khun Phra Nai. Is that right, Miss?

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:13.720
Oh, don’t say that.

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:21.840
Aww, who else in this city wouldn't know that you’re his fiancé, Miss?

00:24:22.840 --> 00:24:24.920
Try it, Ruedee.

00:24:27.440 --> 00:24:30.920
It’s so beautiful I wouldn’t dare to eat it, Miss.

00:24:31.160 --> 00:24:38.200
Stop being so pretentious…I mean, just do as you’re told.

00:24:39.800 --> 00:24:45.480
Apart from my brother, I’d like to know if other people will also find this dessert to their liking.

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:49.000
Yes, Miss.

00:25:17.720 --> 00:25:22.520
How is it? Do you like it?

00:25:27.880 --> 00:25:34.120
This rascal! She’s asking you, why aren’t you answering? So rude.

00:25:34.720 --> 00:25:42.240
It’s you who are rude, Som. Don’t you see her mouth is still full of food? How would she be able to talk?

00:25:42.640 --> 00:25:44.960
Oh, you’re right, Miss.

00:25:44.960 --> 00:25:49.920
So, do you like my dessert?

00:26:15.600 --> 00:26:17.040
What happened, Miss Ruedee?

00:26:20.920 --> 00:26:22.320
Is that blood?

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:26.040
What happened?

00:26:31.880 --> 00:26:33.400
Glass shards?

00:26:40.720 --> 00:26:47.160
Serve her right. She won’t be able to eat anything for a while, Miss.

00:27:01.600 --> 00:27:07.280
This is just a warning. If she keeps pestering my man, it’ll be worse.

00:27:07.920 --> 00:27:13.760
That’s right, Miss. For someone who doesn’t know her place, she really deserves it.

00:27:23.600 --> 00:27:24.960
Where’s my brother, though?

00:27:25.360 --> 00:27:29.280
I have no idea, Miss. I’ve been right by your side all this time.

00:27:38.560 --> 00:27:42.040
Kaew, come downstairs once you’re done. They’re waiting for you to eat together.

00:27:42.280 --> 00:27:43.440
Yes, Dum.

00:28:06.160 --> 00:28:10.480
Khun Yai, what are you doing here?

00:28:37.760 --> 00:28:42.600
Kaew, I miss you so much.

00:29:55.040 --> 00:29:56.160
Kaew.

00:30:00.800 --> 00:30:01.800
Kaew.

00:31:22.040 --> 00:31:25.400
This is a chamber for the dancers, Miss.

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:33.560
Wait. Have you seen Khun Phra Nai?

00:31:40.680 --> 00:31:41.880
No, Miss.

00:31:42.680 --> 00:31:44.120
Please excuse me.

00:31:44.440 --> 00:31:50.960
Geez, servants here are not helpful at all.

00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:53.320
They should have helped looking for him first.

00:32:03.200 --> 00:32:04.440
Let’s go, Som.

00:32:04.560 --> 00:32:06.040
Yes, Miss.

00:32:32.920 --> 00:32:34.240
Sophee.

00:32:35.440 --> 00:32:37.560
What are you doing here, Brother?

00:32:37.840 --> 00:32:41.360
I’m here to see how Uncle has kept his instruments.

00:32:42.000 --> 00:32:43.240
Is that so?

00:32:44.720 --> 00:32:47.320
But I can’t see any instrument here, Miss.

00:32:52.240 --> 00:32:53.480
Kaewta…

00:32:57.040 --> 00:32:59.440
Are you looking for me, Sophee?

00:33:00.040 --> 00:33:03.840
Kaewta and the others were cleaning the instruments when I came here.

00:33:04.200 --> 00:33:06.360
I was so engrossed with the conservation that I forgot the time completely.

00:33:06.800 --> 00:33:12.000
I see. Kaewta must be very fun to talk with, so much that you even forget about me.

00:33:12.680 --> 00:33:14.680
I’m getting quite offended now.

00:33:15.920 --> 00:33:19.600
It’s not like that, Miss. We were only talking about…

00:33:20.640 --> 00:33:22.040
about Uncle, Miss.

00:33:22.920 --> 00:33:27.960
Yes. I told him about that time when I learnt how to play treble fiddle with Uncle.

00:33:27.960 --> 00:33:30.320
Back then, Uncle was very strict.

00:33:30.320 --> 00:33:34.400
There was once when I sneaked out to hang around and got caught.

00:33:34.400 --> 00:33:37.320
Uncle punished me by having me clean all the instruments here.

00:33:38.320 --> 00:33:40.320
I also got punished like that.

00:33:44.360 --> 00:33:47.720
I see. Both of you were actually gossiping about your teacher.

00:33:49.680 --> 00:33:52.080
But why did you shut the door though?

00:33:54.800 --> 00:33:57.600
You wouldn’t have called it ‘gossiping’ then.

00:33:58.720 --> 00:33:59.640
True that.

00:34:02.880 --> 00:34:05.240
Please excuse me then.

00:34:06.840 --> 00:34:08.040
Yes.

00:34:13.679 --> 00:34:18.920
Kaewta can dance so beautifully. That’s why he’s Uncle’s best student, isn’t he?

00:34:20.199 --> 00:34:23.480
Even though he’s a man, right, Miss?

00:34:26.639 --> 00:34:27.440
Yes.

00:34:36.320 --> 00:34:37.920
How are you feeling?

00:34:40.440 --> 00:34:43.239
Better now. The bleeding has stopped.

00:34:45.159 --> 00:34:47.960
Have you done anyting to upset Lady Sophee?

00:34:49.639 --> 00:34:52.679
Is she upset with me?

00:34:53.080 --> 00:34:55.440
But those glass shards in the dessert…

00:34:56.239 --> 00:35:01.080
I suppose she must have accidentally dropped them in the dessert she made for me.

00:35:02.120 --> 00:35:04.320
Perhaps, she didn’t mean it, Saen.

00:35:04.720 --> 00:35:06.320
Do you really believe that?

00:35:06.760 --> 00:35:11.520
Lady Sophee is very nice to me. She treats me as if I were her friend.

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:14.880
She probably didn’t know there were glass shards in the dessert.

00:35:15.720 --> 00:35:18.440
But that doesn’t sound like Lady Sophee that I know at all.

00:35:20.080 --> 00:35:22.920
What do you mean, Saen?

00:35:25.040 --> 00:35:26.280
It’s nothing.

00:35:26.840 --> 00:35:32.640
Anyway, maybe it’d be better for you to try to steer clear of her.

00:35:35.040 --> 00:35:38.280
Why are you telling me this?

00:35:39.160 --> 00:35:40.400
Well, I’m…

00:35:45.200 --> 00:35:46.440
…worried about you.

00:36:11.680 --> 00:36:12.480
Ruedee!

00:36:14.040 --> 00:36:14.840
Yes, Kaew?

00:36:15.240 --> 00:36:17.480
Oh, you’re here too?

00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:19.240
Yes, Khun Kaew.

00:36:23.000 --> 00:36:24.840
Is there something wrong?

00:36:25.240 --> 00:36:26.960
- Nothing, Kaew!
- Nothing!

00:36:27.720 --> 00:36:29.480
But why are you two…

00:36:30.080 --> 00:36:31.600
There’s really nothing.

00:36:33.640 --> 00:36:38.800
Thank you, Saen. I’m going then.

00:36:39.600 --> 00:36:40.400
Yes.

00:36:42.680 --> 00:36:43.840
Let’s go, Kaew.

00:36:44.040 --> 00:36:48.520
- But I think there’s something going on between...
- It’s really nothing. Let’s go.

00:37:15.040 --> 00:37:20.840
Kaew, I’m not going to lose you to anyone. I’ll do it today.

00:37:26.600 --> 00:37:28.360
‘I’m worried about you…’

00:37:28.800 --> 00:37:30.920
Worried about you?

00:37:31.120 --> 00:37:33.840
Geez, Kaew. I’m not going to tell you next time.

00:37:39.040 --> 00:37:42.960
Kan! I thought you’d already gone home.

00:37:43.720 --> 00:37:46.960
Kaew, I have something to talk to you.

00:37:50.600 --> 00:37:55.600
Well then, I’ll head home first. I have to go help Mum in the kitchen.

00:37:56.920 --> 00:37:57.720
Yes.

00:38:12.200 --> 00:38:13.600
Do you like it here?

00:38:17.800 --> 00:38:22.080
I never thought it’d look so pretty in the evening.

00:38:32.240 --> 00:38:36.080
So, what is it that you want to talk to me, Kan?

00:38:38.520 --> 00:38:43.480
Well, I…I…

00:38:44.440 --> 00:38:49.200
Why are you stuttering? Just say it.

00:38:50.360 --> 00:38:54.680
This little brother is always here to listen to you.

00:38:58.080 --> 00:39:00.280
Do you only see me as your brother?

00:39:02.720 --> 00:39:06.760
Of course, why are you asking that?

00:39:07.520 --> 00:39:13.240
If you really see me as your brother, will you take heed of a warning from this brother of yours?

00:39:13.400 --> 00:39:15.360
What do you warn me about?

00:39:17.360 --> 00:39:18.600
About Khun Phra Nai.

00:39:23.240 --> 00:39:24.600
What about him?

00:39:26.840 --> 00:39:31.800
You have feelings for him, don’t you?

00:39:50.440 --> 00:39:54.480
What did you say? They’re planning to assassinate His Majesty?

00:39:57.120 --> 00:40:03.000
A betrayal member has admitted that to the commanding officer of the Engineer Bridgae, King’s Royal Guard.

00:40:05.080 --> 00:40:08.880
A betrayal member? Who is he?

00:40:16.120 --> 00:40:21.760
[A few days earlier]

00:40:40.440 --> 00:40:42.680
It’s Luang Sinad Yotaruk, Father.

00:40:48.640 --> 00:40:50.720
Luang Sinad Yotaruk…

00:40:52.720 --> 00:40:53.680
It’s you.

00:40:56.640 --> 00:40:57.440
Yes, sir.

00:41:11.920 --> 00:41:13.880
Luang Sinad Yotaruk.

00:41:15.920 --> 00:41:19.600
He probably got chosen by a lucky draw. That’s why he was so scared.

00:41:20.120 --> 00:41:25.480
Yes, Father. Since he was too scared to do it himself,

00:41:25.800 --> 00:41:30.160
he decided to confess to His Serene Highness Prince Punthaprawat.

00:41:31.640 --> 00:41:32.920
At least he still has some guts.

00:41:34.080 --> 00:41:35.120
What’s next then?

00:41:35.760 --> 00:41:38.040
When His Serene Highness Prince found out about it,

00:41:38.360 --> 00:41:42.360
he went straight to inform His Royal Highness Prince Chakrabongse Bhuvanath.

00:41:43.560 --> 00:41:46.160
They are now conducting a secret investigation.

00:41:48.120 --> 00:41:53.840
Good heavens, our holy Buddha is still guarding over our country after all.

00:41:54.640 --> 00:41:59.160
Otherwise, I’m afraid there might have been more bloodshed.

00:42:01.120 --> 00:42:07.640
No one else knows about this except us, Father. Please keep it between us only.

00:42:09.120 --> 00:42:15.560
An important information like this shouldn’t be leaked out to anyone, including those in our household.

00:42:20.520 --> 00:42:27.360
And one more thing, Father. I’d like you to talk to Prom.

00:42:29.600 --> 00:42:31.560
Talk to him about what?

00:42:33.680 --> 00:42:39.320
I’m afraid he hasn’t thought it through and still associated himself with those people.

00:42:40.080 --> 00:42:42.800
It might eventually cause him trouble.

00:42:44.360 --> 00:42:51.280
Maybe you’re over worried about it, son. Prom can’t handle anything important like that.

00:42:57.920 --> 00:43:01.800
But I’ll try talking to him for you.

00:43:02.400 --> 00:43:03.680
Thank you, Father.

00:43:16.160 --> 00:43:20.800
Freedom doesn’t fall from the sky!

00:43:21.600 --> 00:43:26.440
It’s something we have to reach out, and grab it with our own hands!

00:43:27.240 --> 00:43:35.120
It’s time for our voice to be heard all over the city!

00:43:37.000 --> 00:43:40.680
This meeting is very important.

00:43:41.560 --> 00:43:48.760
That’s why all of us here should drink an oath of allegiance, like what the palace people often do,

00:43:50.520 --> 00:43:57.160
in order to prove our sincerity and honesty. I hope everyone will agree to it.

00:44:01.920 --> 00:44:08.840
May this blood be our witness, and this water an oath.

00:44:11.640 --> 00:44:20.400
May tonight be a shining light that will lead us to a change!

00:44:22.960 --> 00:44:30.360
Drink it to swear an oath of loyalty to our ideology.

00:44:31.280 --> 00:44:38.800
That we will never betray each other, even if it means death!

00:44:41.760 --> 00:44:42.560
Let’s drink it!

00:44:52.640 --> 00:44:53.440
Cheers!

00:45:17.640 --> 00:45:21.080
here the absolute monarchy.

00:45:21.080 --> 00:45:24.320
here the absolute monarchy.

00:45:24.320 --> 00:45:27.600
Here, the absolute monarchy!!!

00:45:57.040 --> 00:45:58.680
What's troubling you?

00:45:58.680 --> 00:46:00.480
It's nothing.

00:46:00.480 --> 00:46:03.120
Then here's how I shall open your mouth.

00:46:06.040 --> 00:46:08.040
Kaew!

00:46:10.520 --> 00:46:11.320
Mom!

00:46:11.320 --> 00:46:12.720
I was worried so nothing.

00:46:12.720 --> 00:46:15.360
Turns out Rudee just ran away with her lover.

00:46:15.360 --> 00:46:17.640
Rudee? With her lover?

00:46:22.560 --> 00:46:23.960
Khun Yai.

00:46:30.920 --> 00:46:32.240
You...

00:46:32.840 --> 00:46:34.720
So you're still here.

00:46:34.720 --> 00:46:36.880
I have a flavor to ask you.

00:46:45.160 --> 00:46:48.280
Do you think Prom will stop, sir?

00:46:51.000 --> 00:46:52.520
I really can't tell, Sin.

00:46:53.840 --> 00:46:56.520
What should we do?

00:47:01.400 --> 00:47:04.960
Dace practice, then sword practice.

00:47:06.200 --> 00:47:08.440
Incase we need it.

00:47:10.520 --> 00:47:12.800
Stop asking so many questions, come!

00:47:14.160 --> 00:47:17.360
Then we slash, slash, slash, slash.

00:48:17.000 --> 00:48:19.920
I got chosen. I was so happy.

00:48:19.920 --> 00:48:22.920
I'll get to dance infront of Pra Phan Pi Ruang.

00:48:23.080 --> 00:48:25.120
But no, I was chosen for...

00:48:25.120 --> 00:48:26.840
For what? Stay tuned.

00:48:26.840 --> 00:48:28.040
I can't tell you.

00:48:28.040 --> 00:48:30.320
But it's definitely not good.

00:48:30.840 --> 00:48:33.600
So no need to be sad if you're not chosen.

00:49:52.160 --> 00:49:56.400
Today is an amazing day
because I finished early again.

00:49:56.400 --> 00:50:01.480
Because I have to talk with Kaewta at Mae Payom's house.

00:50:01.480 --> 00:50:07.560
It's a deep talk, that's why we can't talk at Luang Sanor.

00:50:07.560 --> 00:50:10.560
That's why we have to talk at...

