I talk here and it's inappropriate.

00:50:17.760 --> 00:50:20.600
I have to talk at your house.

00:50:21.280 --> 00:50:24.280
I'm not a fighter but a lover.

00:50:24.680 --> 00:50:27.920
Only action I'm having is with Keawta.

00:50:30.160 --> 00:50:32.440
Those action all day all night.

00:51:04.000 --> 00:51:05.560
